{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa Works the Evening Shift"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Staying up All Night"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 6}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking about Cause and Effect - The Zero Conditional"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the Zero Conditional when you are absolutely certain of the result."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use the Zero Conditional, you don't think of the future, the past, or the present. We think only of a simple fact. <br/>It means: If something happens, then the result is always the same."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">If</span></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">condition</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">result</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Simple</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Simple</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I leave home late,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I miss my bus.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you leave your coffee on the table,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" it gets cold.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I don't eat breakfast, \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I can't think at work.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If I stay up all night, I am useless the next day."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If we watch all the episodes back to back, it takes much less time."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " First & Second Conditional Sentences"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " In these other conditional sentences, we think about the future. We think about a particular condition in the future and the result of this condition."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In the First Conditional, there is a real possibility that this condition will happen.<br/><span class=\"italic\">Example: If I get a raise, I will take you out for dinner.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "In the Second Conditional, there isn't a real possibility that this condition will happen.<br/><span class=\"italic\">Example: If I won the lottery, I would travel the world.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "First Conditional:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">If</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Condition</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Result</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Simple</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> will + base verb</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If it rains,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I will take the bus to work.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Second Conditional:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">If</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Condition</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Result</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Past Simple</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> would + base verb</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If it rained next weekend, \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the company picnic would be cancelled.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Examples</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"First Conditional\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul> <li>If I'm done early, I'll come over.</li> <li>If the director approves it, he will grant me similar projects in the future.</li> <li>If I move up in this company, I could retire at 55.</li> <li>If we keep working at this pace, we won't make it to 55.</li> <li>If you love Jack Bauer as much as I know you do, you won't miss my party.</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Second Conditional\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li> If I did something relaxing, it would take my mind off work. </li> <li>If you listened to her, you would be happier too.</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "useless"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "cannot be used to do anything"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If I stay up all night, I am useless the next day."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob07aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about work-life 